ik-analyzer-rs
Copyright 2025-2026 ik-analyzer-rs contributors

This product is an independent Rust implementation of Chinese word
segmentation. It includes material derived from the projects listed below.
No source files from these projects are vendored in this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. IK Analyzer 2012_u6 — algorithm lineage, dictionaries, and optional parity contract
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright 2012 Lin Liangyi (林良益) / Oolong Studio
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Project: https://code.google.com/p/ik-analyzer/

The segmentation algorithms descend from the IK Analyzer family. Compatibility
with the 2012_u6 behavior is offered as an explicit, opt-in contract
(Config::u6_parity); default behavior is an independent product decision rather
than a line-by-line translation of the Java source. The dictionaries under
dict/ are derived from the IK Analyzer 2012 distribution and have been modified:
line-ending and whitespace handling were adjusted, one entry was added, and the
bundled stop-word list was extended with 69 Chinese entries. See CHANGELOG.md
for the complete list of behavioral changes.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. analysis-ik (infinilabs) — implementation baseline
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Copyright infinilabs and contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Project: https://github.com/infinilabs/analysis-ik (master@6d2d70f)

Used as the implementation baseline: its defect fixes relative to 2012_u6 are
absorbed, and its behavioral changes are exposed as configurable mechanisms.
No source code was copied.

